{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51736","headline":"新定江边作 · 贯休","name":"新定江边作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江边山顶深秋时，身闲潇洒心无爲。\n石头青草取次坐，松风竹风撩乱吹。\n数声好鸟来依我，一点征帆去是谁。\n惆怅古贤何处在，潺潺夕照满江湄。\n（日落山照燿，即此处也。\n以上《严陵集》二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51736.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51736","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}